<hi rend="italics">
The History and Government of Wyoming.  Eleven Editions).
</hi>
</p>
</item>
<item>
<p>
1904
<hsep>
Continued as secretary of the Board of Trustees until 1908 when she was appointed university librarian which office she led until 1919.
</p>
</item>
<item>
<p>
1905
<hsep>
Built &lsquo;The Doctors&apos; Inn&rdquo; with Dr. Agnes M. Wergeland.
</p>
</item>
<item>
<p>
1906
<hsep>
Promoted to associate professorship.
<hsep>
</p>
