<hsep>
Gave untiring service to the American cause in the World War as leader in Wyoming food conservation and Liberty loan speaker.
</p>
</item>
<item>
<p>
1918
<hsep>
Wrote War 
<hi rend="italics">
Service of the University of Wyoming.
</hi>
</p>
</item>
<item>
<p>
1919-20
<hsep>
Wrote 
<hi rend="italics">
How Woman Suffrage Came to Wyoming.
</hi>
</p>
</item>
<item>
